{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110837","id":2854352342,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6qIfXW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110837","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110837.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110837.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110837","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110837/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110837/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110837/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e366471fdcd1959bb3eb23e19f8a395a00220f76","number":110837,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `GDSOFTCLASS` to deeper inheritors of `Object`","user":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nHi all 👋 (cc. @Ivorforce )\r\n\r\nFurther to bug report #110693, which was prematurely closed, and in which it was discovered that static casting errors occur when:\r\n\r\n1. inheriting from `Object`  - directly or otherwise\r\n2. but not defining an appropriate `GDCLASS` or `GDSOFTCLASS` at each child class\r\n\r\nAnd notwithstanding that my previous PR's (#110694 and #110752) fixed part of the problem, by fixing direct children of `Object`. Please note that this is not - however - sufficient, since there can be children deeper in the inheritance tree that will still exhibit this bug.\r\n\r\nThis PR seeks to locate all those remaining - deeper in the inheritance tree from `Object` - and fix them by adding an appropriate `GDSOFTCLASS`.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- `GDSOFTCLASS` added to _many_ classes\r\n- `override` keywords added to public methods in:\r\n    - `editor/export/gdextension_export_plugin.h`\r\n    - `modules/multiplayer/multiplayer_debugger.h`\r\n    - `platform/android/net_socket_android.h`\r\n\r\n## How to validate\r\n\r\n1. install `ripgrep`\r\n2. Use (check first!) this script\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n#!/bin/bash\r\n\r\n# List of parent classes (derived from the PR)\r\nclasses=(\r\n    Object\r\n\tResourceFormatLoader\r\n\tResourceFormatSaver\r\n\tEngineProfiler\r\n\tRefCounted\r\n\tRemoteDebuggerPeer\r\n\tHTTPClient\r\n\tNetSocket\r\n\tEditorDebuggerServer\r\n\tCodeSignBlob\r\n\tEditorExportPlugin\r\n\tShaderBakerExportPluginPlatform\r\n\tNetSocketUnix\r\n\tPhysicsServer2D\r\n\tPhysicsServer3D\r\n\tRenderingDeviceCommons\r\n\tRenderingServer\r\n    NavMeshGenerator2D\r\n    NavMeshGenerator3D\r\n    BetsyCompressor\r\n)\r\n\r\nfor cls in \"${classes[@]}\"; do\r\n\techo \"Searching for classes derived from $cls...\"\r\n\trg --pcre2 -n -H -o --multiline --multiline-dotall \\\r\n\t  \"^(class\\s+(\\w+)\\s*:\\s*public\\s+$cls\\s*\\{(?:(?!GDCLASS|GDSOFTCLASS).)*?\\})\" \\\r\n\t  --glob '*.h' --glob '*.cpp' \\\r\n\t  --glob '!*.gen.h' --glob '!test*.h' \\\r\n\t  --glob '!thirdparty/**' \\\r\n\t  --replace '$2'\r\ndone\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks! 😄 \r\n\r\n## Methodology \r\n\r\nThey were initially found with [this script and output](https://gist.github.com/wheatear-dev/4f8b07613cfa8932cfd3ff8508b7f505), and then manually refined and expanded. Please note that:\r\n\r\n- the script has problems with duplicates (similarly named classes in different files), and can't distinguish them, due to not actually interpreting C++ source code.\r\n- some classes were manually marked with `SKIP` in the output, since they were either a duplicate - of a similarly named class that does descend from `Object` - or a descendant of such a duplicate.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_